        <li>
          Built an analytical cost model for multi-chip scaling behavior, unifying several interconnect
          topology families under a single latency and energy notation.
        </li>
        <li>This work is proprietary; its detailed results and architectural specifics are not disclosed here.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
