  <h2>Skills</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Software</strong>: Python (PyTorch, JAX), C/C++, CUDA, LLVM/MLIR, Z3 SMT solver, RISC-V/ARM/x86 assembly</li>
    <li><strong>Hardware</strong>: SystemVerilog, Verilog, SystemC/TLM, AXI, high-level synthesis (Siemens Catapult, Xilinx Vivado), Synopsys ASIP Designer, logic synthesis, design for test</li>
    <li><strong>Tools</strong>: Git, Docker, Linux administration, Slurm, CI/CD, Jenkins, Atlassian tools, qTest, Selenium</li>
